	(text "TODO:\n- Add more vias to EPAD, make sure they are of the 'ENCROACHED' style,\n  which is to say, that they are open on the top and solder-mask-defined\n  on the bottom. See Microchip AN18.15 for details. They recommend:\n  0.25-0.3mm FHS and 0.055-0.075mm larger solder mask opening.\n  ... I don't think KiCAD can do this kind of thing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 130.81 0)
		(effects
