		)
		(uuid "88841aef-2040-4f4c-b5c6-a549869ea1f7")
	)
	(text "Fixed"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9a07a684-3616-4e83-bc22-34e873f04f41")
	)
	(text "According to AN184, default pin behavior:\n\nADBUS0 TXD  Output\nADBUS1 RXD  Input-PU\nADBUS2 RTS# Output\nADBUS3 CTS# Input-PU\nADBUS4 DTR# Output\nADBUS5 DSR# Input-PU\nADBUS6 DCD# Input-PU\nADBUS7 RI#  Input-PU\n\nSo TCK and TDO might toggle during enumeration,\nbut TMS would be held high, which will keep/reset\nthe JTAG FSM to test-logic-reset state. Thus, \nno isolation is needed.\n\nFurthermore JTAG_SEL_N is pulled up, not risking\nintefreing with alternate JTAG pin behavior (such as serial).\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.31 295.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9d5cce77-f899-4ab4-b361-08728b98c594")
	)
